<title>UK: Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs up one at 63.</title>
<headline>Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs up one at 63.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs operating offshore Northwest Europe rose one to 63 last week, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>Rigs active in British waters rose two to 29 while the Norwegian sector was steady at 19. The Dutch sector was down to nine rigs, one less than the previous week. Ireland kept one rig running and the Danish sector was unchanged at five.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7630.</p>
